{
  "projects": {
    "default": "demo-linyup",
    "sandbox": "linyup-sandbox",
    "staging": "linyup-staging",
    "production": "linyup-prod"
  },
  "_comment_targets": [
    "Only `landing` is a real Firebase Hosting target — apps/landing is the static",
    "marketing site and firebase.json configures exactly that one.",
    "",
    "There used to be an `app` target here too, pointing at the {project} sites",
    "(linyup-staging.web.app and friends). It predates the web app moving to App",
    "Hosting and was never removed: firebase.json has no `app` config and no",
    "workflow deploys hosting:app, so those sites were provisioned-but-empty and",
    "served a bare 404 to anything pointing at them — which is exactly what",
    "staging's HOSTING_URL did until 2026-08-14. Removed so the config no longer",
    "advertises a deploy target that does not exist. The web apps live on App",
    "Hosting: app.linyup.com, app-stg.linyup.com, demo.linyup.com — with",
    "linyup.com itself reserved for the `landing` target above."
  ],
  "targets": {
    "linyup-sandbox": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-sandbox-landing"
        ]
      }
    },
    "linyup-staging": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-staging-landing"
        ]
      }
    },
    "linyup-prod": {
      "hosting": {
        "landing": [
          "linyup-prod-landing"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "etags": {}
}
